ies  and then eventually it could transition  to him you know approaching the tree  getting the power of the titans and then  meeting aaron in the past dimension  what happens after that is anyone's  guess but obviously because this is set  in the future the world has superior  technology compared to the original  series  so having titans buy by themselves might  not be enough to win any future wars  anyway guys let me know what you think  might take place if baron really does  become the new founder  and be sure to hit that sub button if  you want to see more videos like this  until the next one peace out

